$ pda help dump
$ pda dump --help
Dump all key/value pairs as NDJSON

Usage:
  pda dump [DB] [flags]

Aliases:
  dump, export

Flags:
  -e, --encoding string   value encoding: auto, base64, or text (default "auto")
  -h, --help              help for dump
      --secret            Include entries marked as secret
